    779  f0e9							;   open bands — wall PF hides it elsewhere)
    780  f0e9		       85 88		      sta	Temp	; bugs.md #15: also stage the door color into
    781  f0eb							;   Temp, so .ObjZero's plain restore keeps
    782  f0eb							;   the stripe yellow (0 extra cycles on the
    783  f0eb							;   object line; +3c here on the setup line)
