    915  f125							; Object off: ObjBase=$FF sentinel (ObjTop parked 144). S2.2: ObjTop is RoomY-relative;
    916  f125							; Y here = A0+1 = next line's A0, so `Y - ObjTopRel` = Scanline - ObjTop
