   1121  f1fb							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1122  f1fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1123  f1fb							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1124  f1fb							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1125  f1fb							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1126  f1fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1127  f1fb				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1128  f1fb							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
