   2020  f5f7							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2021  f5f7							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2022  f5f7							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2023  f5f7							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2024  f5f7							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2025  f5f7							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2026  f5f7							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2027  f5f7							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2028  f5f7							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2029  f5f7							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2030  f5f7							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
