   2351  f786							; CallPad_RaftBody — bank1 RaftBody entry. Pinned at $F8C0 with a
   2352  f786							; BYTE-IDENTICAL twin in bank1 (bank1.asm, same address): the `sta $1FF7`
   2353  f786							; switches banks, so the `jmp` opcode AND its operand are fetched from bank1,
   2354  f786							; not from here. That is the same FoldIndirect discipline every other tramp
   2355  f786							; uses — the twin cannot be skipped or shortened.
   2356  f786							; Guard: verify_build.check_raft_tramp (identity + operand == bank1 RaftBody).
