   3360  fcb3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3361  fcb3							; LoseLifeBand — life path + respawn just above the water strip.
   3362  fcb3							; The shift MUST happen BEFORE LoseLife: its stay path tail-jumps DropArm,
   3363  fcb3							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3364  fcb3							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3365  fcb3							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
   3366  fcb3							; The shift is one tile (spec: -= 12, not the whole band): the band check
   3367  fcb3							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 125), so 125 -> 113 clears the strip.
   3368  fcb3							; Tail-jmps LoseLife (never returns here): its exhausted path rts straight to
   3369  fcb3							; CheckBandTouch.
