   3641  fdcb							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3642  fdcb							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3643  fdcb							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
