   3795  fe90							; FoldIndirect — cross-bank data fetch (HERO fold, write-triggered;
   3796  fe90							; level_bank_plan §0.1). Pad lands $FEF6-$FEFF (last byte ≤ $FEFF — $FF00
   3797  fe90							; stays the fineAdjust anchor). Bytes must be byte-identical in bank2
