   3963  ff33							; LaserInput — contact missile (redesign 2026-10-08, replaces the S3 sweep):
   3964  ff33							; the beam is ONE 8px bar that LEAVES the EYE and travels +/-4px/frame toward
   3965  ff33							; the facing until contact, then resets to the eye (single missile, KISS —
   3966  ff33							; user spec: no piercing, no HERO comparison needed).
   3967  ff33							;   press edge (b7 held, b6 prev): LaserX = eye  (right RoomX-1 = nose,
   3968  ff33							;						  left	RoomX-4)
   3969  ff33							;   held frame: LaserX +/-4; LaserX >= 160 (right edge OR left underflow
   3970  ff33							;     wrap) -> reset to eye (unsigned check catches both)
   3971  ff33							;   contact (bank2 LaserHitTestBody): A = 0 continue / $50 kill (+score,
   3972  ff33							;     dead bit set in body) / 1 lamp (SetRoomDark) / 2 wall tip -> all three
   3973  ff33							;     contact kinds reset LaserX = eye BEFORE positioning (missile consumed;
   3974  ff33							;     tip-in-wall never draws: contact frame restarts at the eye; PF has
   3975  ff33							;     priority over M0 anyway).
   3976  ff33							;   release: b7/b1 cleared in the prologue, HMM0 = 0; LaserX kept (next
   3977  ff33							;     press edge re-anchors).
   3978  ff33							; PIXEL MODEL (unchanged): SetObjectXPos arg A -> drawn M0 = [A-7, A].
   3979  ff33							; LaserState: b7 held, b6 prev (press edge), b5-2 dark, b1 = .Line gate,
   3980  ff33							; b0 = rearm (contact consumed last frame — re-test the eye next frame)
   3981  ff33							; (PlayerColTable bit1 shares b1 — ENAM0 = bit1 & LaserState; the old
   3982  ff33							; LaserBeamOn $02 byte now holds LaserX, there was no free ZP byte).
   3983  ff33							; S5.4: kill/lamp/wall ACTIONS run here (pad body returns only A).
   3984  ff33							; Overscan: VBLANK on, end waits on TIM64T — SetObjectXPos's WSYNC costs 1
   3985  ff33							; of 30 lines. Temp (joystick) intact. Lives after $FF20 (pre-$FF00 full).
   3986  ff33							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
